{
 "part": "script/script_0056",
 "entries": [
  {
   "key": "script:0056:07D2",
   "src": "02d8c178e503",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Bueno, ¿revisamos<NL>bien este bloque?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:07F3",
   "src": "c6d5698a38c9",
   "t": "<FACE:00>¡No! ¡A simple vista<NL>esto es rarísimo!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:080F",
   "src": "e042ac8b3d33",
   "t": "<FACE:04>Con la prisa que hay,<NL>mejor empecemos aquí…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0824",
   "src": "6721fa1aad06",
   "t": "<FACE:05><PLAYER>, revisa esto<NL>Yo voy para allá"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0846",
   "src": "efa5df3b0b6d",
   "t": "<FACE:0F>Yo iré por aquel lado…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0857",
   "src": "d13b6871b886",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>Yo por acá…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0862",
   "src": "ed6f5566f588",
   "t": "<FACE:04>¿Qué les pasa a todos?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0870",
   "src": "2f4fd1006f7a",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Vaya, están algo<NL>viejos, pero hay unos<WAIT>videos bastante buenos"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0898",
   "src": "09b7ada775b5",
   "t": "<FACE:05>…Ah, <PLAYER>…<NL>Lo que tú revisas es<WAIT>¡lo que hay tras esa<NL>manta colgada!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:08BD",
   "src": "4214c359ec83",
   "t": "<FACE:0F>Saber qué come el<NL>enemigo sirve mucho<WAIT>para trazar un plan…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:08ED",
   "src": "6c22a4c4205c",
   "t": "<FACE:04>¿Será cierto…?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0922",
   "src": "307bdf777cb2",
   "t": "<FACE:73>Tu fortuna de hoy es…<NL>¡Desgracia!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:093C",
   "src": "2c01e3343b3c",
   "t": "<FACE:05>Parece que terminaron<NL>¿Empezamos ya?"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0956",
   "src": "f5f00e69c341",
   "t": "<FACE:0C>Eso no es lo mío,<NL>¿me disculpas?<WAIT><FACE:0F>Lo siento, <PLAYER><NL>no me hace sentir bien"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0983",
   "src": "363e7a636945",
   "t": "<FACE:73>…Ustedes son los<NL>elegidos del destino…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:099B",
   "src": "4f9c3df4d8dd",
   "t": "<FACE:73>…Esta victoria es la<NL>puerta de una derrota…<NL>"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:09B5",
   "src": "5f26b06932d2",
   "t": "<FACE:73>…Lo sabía… tu fortuna<NL>de hoy… ¡Desgracia!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:09CF",
   "src": "d200b5041072",
   "t": "<FACE:08>¡Ay, no, no y no!<WAIT><FACE:06>¡¿Por qué tuve que oír<NL>ese «tilín»?!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:09F7",
   "src": "f5b9320014f9",
   "t": "<FACE:0A>De vez en cuando no<NL>está mal descansar…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A0F",
   "src": "ea1fbc835fbe",
   "t": "<FACE:15>No me hables ahora…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A23",
   "src": "6fe13b07d86e",
   "t": "<FACE:19>Mmm…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A41",
   "src": "44b715a5bf6b",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Tenemos que seguir<NL>adentro, rápido"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A53",
   "src": "eb8f561100e9",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Uf…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A5A",
   "src": "79ccd1bc5d7a",
   "t": "<FACE:02>¡Bueno, en marcha!"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A65",
   "src": "efebd32c1d3a",
   "t": "<FACE:02>Frota, frota, frota…"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A73",
   "src": "3eca3444a96c",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Parece que hay puros<NL>videos clásicos aquí"
  },
  {
   "key": "script:0056:0A8B",
   "src": "d6e469854114",
   "t": "<FACE:00>Una cocina…<NL><WAIT>¿No está algo sucia?"
  }
 ]
}
